#, kde-format
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Hrvatski prevoditelji"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "Vaše adrese e-pošte"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard Add-Ons"
msgstr "Dodaci za RKWard"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To offer you the best features, RKWard combines different technologies. "
"Arguably this can make it a bit confusing on where to find the addon "
"features you are looking for."
msgstr "Kako bi vam ponudio što bolje mogućnosti, RKWard objedinjuje različite tehnologije. Zbog toga ponekad može biti nejasno gdje pronaći željene dodatne mogućnosti."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid "In a nutshell:"
msgstr "Ukratko:"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<strong>R packages</strong> offer a sheer incredible amount of data "
"algorithms and tools. This functionality is (mostly) provided in the form of "
"additional R functions that you can use in scripts, or in the interactive R "
"console."
msgstr "<strong>Paketi R-a</strong> nude nevjerojatno mnogo algoritama i alata za rad s podacima. Ta se funkcionalnost (uglavnom) pruža u obliku dodatnih funkcija R-a koje možete koristiti u skriptama ili interaktivnoj konzoli R-a."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Kate add-ons</strong>: Kate is the engine behind RKWard's script "
"editor. It comes with powerful add-on features, many of which should come "
"pre-installed with RKWard. However, due to their sheer number, not all are "
"activated by default. It can further be extended with custom scripts, or "
"color-schemes."
msgstr "<strong>Dodaci za Kate</strong>: Kate je temelj RKWardova uređivača skripti. Nudi snažne dodatne mogućnosti, od kojih bi mnoge trebale biti unaprijed instalirane s RKWardom. No zbog njihova velikog broja nisu sve zadano aktivirane. Kate možete dodatno proširiti prilagođenim skriptama ili shemama boja."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<strong>RKWard plugins</strong>: If you are looking for a graphical dialog "
"to help you import/convert/analyse/visualize your data, such dialogs are "
"mostly implemented as plugin-ins in RKWard. Many such plugins are available "
"for download, separately."
msgstr "<strong>Dodaci za RKWard</strong>: Ako tražite grafički dijalog koji će vam pomoći u uvozu, pretvorbi, analizi ili vizualizaciji podataka, takvi se dijalozi u RKWardu uglavnom ostvaruju kao dodaci. Mnogi su dostupni za zasebno preuzimanje."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The following sections deal with these, in turn, showing you how to find / "
"install, what you need."
msgstr "Sljedeći odjeljci redom opisuju te dodatke i pokazuju kako pronaći i instalirati ono što vam je potrebno."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:24
#, kde-format
msgid "R packages"
msgstr "Paketi R-a"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="R packages">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In addition to the regular R command line tools for managing R packages (see "
"<link href=\"rkward://rhelp/install.packages\"/>), RKWard offers a graphical "
"dialog to search, install and/or load packages (Settings->Manage R packages "
"and plugins)."
msgstr "Uz uobičajene alate naredbenog retka R-a za upravljanje paketima (pogledajte <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/install.packages\"/>), RKWard nudi grafički dijalog za pretraživanje, instalaciju i/ili učitavanje paketa (Postavke->Upravljanje paketima i dodacima za R)."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="R packages">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Note that, by default, R packages are distributed as compiled binaries on "
"Windows and MacOS, but not Linux. While for the latter, installation from "
"source is fully automated, you may still have to install additional "
"libraries or other software for the compilation."
msgstr "Imajte na umu da se paketi R-a zadano distribuiraju kao prevedene binarne datoteke za Windows i macOS, ali ne i za Linux. Iako je instalacija iz izvornog koda na Linuxu potpuno automatizirana, možda ćete ipak morati instalirati dodatne biblioteke ili drugi softver za prevođenje."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:32
#, kde-format
msgid "Kate Add-ons"
msgstr "Dodaci za Kate"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="Kate Add-ons">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:32
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<link href=\"https://kate.kde.org\">Kate</link> is a very powerful text "
"editor using the same text editing component that is also used in RKWard. It "
"also comes with a variety of add-ons, e.g. for creating code snippets, or "
"for managing projects in a git repository. Some of these - like e.g. the C++ "
"backtrace navigation tool do not make much sense in the context of RKWard, "
"but many do. To explore what is available, make sure you have kate "
"installed, then visit <link href=\"rkward://settings/addons\">Settings-"
">Addons</link>. Addons shown in bold have been reported to be useful and "
"work well in RKWard, but feel free to explore the others, too."
msgstr "<link href=\"https://kate.kde.org\">Kate</link> je vrlo moćan uređivač teksta koji koristi istu komponentu za uređivanje teksta kao i RKWard. Dolazi i s raznim dodacima, primjerice za izradu isječaka koda ili upravljanje projektima u Gitovu repozitoriju. Neki od njih, kao alat za navigaciju kroz povratni trag C++-a, nisu osobito korisni u RKWardu, no mnogi jesu. Da biste istražili dostupne dodatke, provjerite je li Kate instaliran, a zatim otvorite <link href=\"rkward://settings/addons\">Postavke->Dodaci</link>. Poznato je da su dodaci prikazani podebljano korisni i dobro rade u RKWardu, no slobodno isprobajte i ostale."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard Plugins"
msgstr "Dodaci za RKWard"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="RKWard Plugins">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard plugins can be installed from a variety of sources, but the usual "
"distribution of add-on packages is via R packages. To look for R packages "
"that provide RKWard graphical dialogs, use the regular dialog (<link href="
"\"rkward://actions/rpackage_install\">Settings->Manage R packages and "
"plugins</link>), and check the option \"Show only packages providing RKWard "
"dialogs\"."
msgstr "Dodaci za RKWard mogu se instalirati iz različitih izvora, no uobičajeno se distribuiraju kao paketi R-a. Da biste pronašli pakete R-a koji nude grafičke dijaloge za RKWard, otvorite uobičajeni dijalog (<link href=\"rkward://actions/rpackage_install\">Postavke->Upravljanje paketima i dodacima za R</link>) i označite mogućnost „Prikaži samo pakete koji nude dijaloge za RKWard”."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="RKWard Plugins">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Not all RKWard plugins packaged this way will be visible in the R package "
"installation dialog, as they are not hosted (yet) in the default "
"repositories, notably, at the time of this writing, the very extensive <link "
"href=\"https://github.com/rkward-community/rk.Teaching\">rk.Teaching</link> "
"set of plugins. Many of these are hosted on platforms such as github.com, "
"and knowing the repository url, can be installed with few clicks, using "
"<link href=\"rkward://runplugin/rkward::install_from_git/fullURL."
"text=https://github.com/rkward-community/rk.Teaching.git\">this dialog</"
"link> (pre-initialized for installation of rk.Teaching)."
msgstr "U dijalogu za instalaciju paketa R-a neće biti vidljivi svi dodaci za RKWard koji se distribuiraju na taj način jer još nisu dostupni u zadanim repozitorijima. Primjerice, u trenutku pisanja ovog teksta ondje nije dostupan opsežan skup dodataka <link href=\"https://github.com/rkward-community/rk.Teaching\">rk.Teaching</link>. Mnogi se nalaze na platformama poput github.com; ako znate URL repozitorija, možete ih instalirati u nekoliko klikova pomoću <link href=\"rkward://runplugin/rkward::install_from_git/fullURL.text=https://github.com/rkward-community/rk.Teaching.git\">ovog dijaloga</link> (unaprijed postavljenog za instalaciju rk.Teachinga)."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Creating your own RKWard Plugins"
msgstr "Izrada vlastitih dodataka za RKWard"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="Creating your own RKWard Plugins">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Still missing something?"
msgstr "Nedostaje vam još nešto?"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Add-Ons) <section title="Creating your own RKWard Plugins">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_addons.rkh:47
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check out the <link href=\"help:/rkwardplugins/index.html\">Introduction to "
"Writing Plugins for RKWard</link> (<link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/doc/"
"rkwardplugins/\">most recent version online</link>) to learn how easy it is "
"to enhance RKWard with your custom dialogs. And if you like, how to share "
"your work with the community of RKWard users. See the <link href=\"rkward://"
"rhelp/rkward-package\">rkward package overview</link> for RKWard specific "
"function for development and scripting."
msgstr "Pročitajte <link href=\"help:/rkwardplugins/index.html\">Uvod u pisanje dodataka za RKWard</link> (<link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/doc/rkwardplugins/\">najnoviju inačicu na internetu</link>) i saznajte koliko je jednostavno proširiti RKWard prilagođenim dijalozima. Ondje možete saznati i kako podijeliti svoj rad sa zajednicom korisnika RKWarda. Pregled funkcija paketa <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/rkward-package\">rkward</link> specifičnih za RKWardov razvoj i skriptiranje potražite u dokumentaciji paketa."

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode"
msgstr "Navigacija kodom i način brze navigacije kodom"

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The code navigation feature in script editor windows allows you to navigate "
"R code based on its syntactical structure, e.g. quickly jumping to the next "
"statement outside the current scope or to the previous top level statement. "
"Several navigation features are deliberately close to debugging in R's <link "
"href=\"rkward://rhelp/browser\">browser()</link>-command, but importantly "
"this works entirely without actually running the code."
msgstr "Mogućnost navigacije kodom u prozorima uređivača skripti omogućuje kretanje kroz kod R-a prema njegovoj sintaktičkoj strukturi, primjerice brzi prijelaz na sljedeću naredbu izvan trenutačnog opsega ili na prethodnu naredbu najviše razine. Nekoliko je mogućnosti navigacije namjerno slično otklanjanju pogrešaka naredbom <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/browser\">browser()</link> u R-u, ali važno je da sve to radi bez stvarnog pokretanja koda."

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid "Available commands"
msgstr "Dostupne naredbe"

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="Available commands">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The code navigation feature is available from the <i>Run</i>-menu, and the "
"context menu in script (R or R markdown) windows in two variants: The first "
"option is to simply select individual navigation actions directly from the "
"menu. Secondly, however, the \"Quick Code Navigation Mode\" (top entry in "
"the menu; default keyboard shortcut is \"Meta+n\") allows you to navigate "
"your sources very quickly. Once in this mode, subsequent single key presses "
"invoke the following actions:"
msgstr ""
"Značajka navigacije kroz kod dostupna je u izborniku <i>Pokreni</i> i "
"kontekstnom izborniku prozora skripti (R ili R Markdown), u dva oblika: "
"prva je mogućnost jednostavno odabrati pojedinačne radnje navigacije "
"izravno iz izbornika. Druga je mogućnost „Brzi način navigacije kroz kod” "
"(prva stavka izbornika; zadani tipkovni prečac je „Meta+n”), koji omogućuje "
"vrlo brzu navigaciju kroz izvorni kod. U tom načinu rada sljedeće se radnje "
"izvode pritiskom na odgovarajuću tipku:"

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="Available commands">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<table border=\"0\"> <tr><td><tt><b>n / N</b></tt></td><td>Go to the next "
"(n) or previous (N) statement at the current level, or the next outer level</"
"td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>i / I</b></tt></td><td>Like n/N, but also step into "
"inner contexts (such as the definition of a function)</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>o / O</b></tt></td><td>Jump directly to the next / previous "
"statement outside the current level (e.g. the first statement after a "
"function body)</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>t / T</b></tt></td><td>Go to the "
"next / previous statement at the topmost level of the script</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>c / C</b></tt></td><td>(For R Markdown documents, only:) Go "
"to the next / previous code chunk</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>1 / !</b></tt></"
"td><td>Go to the top / bottom of the document</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>s</"
"b></tt></td><td>Select the current statement</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>S</b></"
"tt></td><td>(For R Markdown documents, only:) Select add code in the current "
"chunk</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>r</b></tt></td><td>Run the current statement "
"and advance to the next statement (equivalent to the sequence <tt>s - Ctrl"
"+Return - n</tt>)</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>Backspace</b></tt></td><td>Go "
"back to the position before the latest action</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>Esc</"
"b></tt></td><td>Exit Quick Code Navigation mode, and reset the cursor / "
"selection to the state before entering it</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>Return</"
"b></tt></td><td>Exit Quick Code Navigation mode, keeping current position/"
"selection</td></tr> <tr><td/><td>Quick Code Navigation mode will also end, "
"if you click anywhere else in the script, switch to a different window, or "
"the script is modified</td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\"> </td></tr> <tr><td "
"colspan=\"2\">Finally, you can continue to use regular shortcuts, while in "
"Quick Code Navigation mode. This includes, importantly:</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>Ctrl+Return</b></tt></td><td>Run the current line or "
"selection</td></tr> </table>"
msgstr ""
"<table border=\"0\"> <tr><td><tt><b>n / N</b></tt></td><td>Prijeđi na "
"sljedeću (n) ili prethodnu (N) naredbu na trenutačnoj razini ili na "
"sljedeću vanjsku razinu</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>i / I</b></tt></td><td>Kao "
"n/N, ali prelazi i u unutarnje kontekste (primjerice definiciju "
"funkcije)</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>o / O</b></tt></td><td>Izravno prijeđi "
"na sljedeću / prethodnu naredbu izvan trenutačne razine (npr. prvu naredbu "
"nakon tijela funkcije)</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>t / T</b></tt></td><td>Prijeđi "
"na sljedeću / prethodnu naredbu na najvišoj razini skripte</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>c / C</b></tt></td><td>(Samo za dokumente R Markdown:) "
"Prijeđi na sljedeći / prethodni blok koda</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>1 / "
"!</b></tt></td><td>Prijeđi na početak / kraj dokumenta</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>s</b></tt></td><td>Odaberi trenutačnu naredbu</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>S</b></tt></td><td>(Samo za dokumente R Markdown:) Odaberi "
"dodatni kod u trenutačnom bloku</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>r</b></tt></td><td>"
"Pokreni trenutačnu naredbu i prijeđi na sljedeću (isto kao niz "
"<tt>s - Ctrl+Return - n</tt>)</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>Backspace</b></tt></td>"
"<td>Vrati se na položaj prije posljednje radnje</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>Esc</b></tt></td><td>Izađi iz brzog načina navigacije kroz "
"kod i vrati pokazivač / odabir u stanje prije njegova uključivanja</td></tr> "
"<tr><td><tt><b>Return</b></tt></td><td>Izađi iz brzog načina navigacije "
"kroz kod, zadržavajući trenutačni položaj/odabir</td></tr> <tr><td/><td>Brzi "
"način navigacije kroz kod završit će i ako kliknete bilo gdje drugdje u "
"skripti, prijeđete u drugi prozor ili izmijenite skriptu</td></tr> "
"<tr><td colspan=\"2\"> </td></tr> <tr><td colspan=\"2\">U brzom načinu "
"navigacije kroz kod možete nastaviti koristiti uobičajene prečace. To "
"uključuje, što je važno:</td></tr> <tr><td><tt><b>Ctrl+Return</b></tt></td>"
"<td>Pokreni trenutačni redak ili odabir</td></tr> </table>"

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid "Notes and Tips"
msgstr "Napomene i savjeti"

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="Notes and Tips">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The 'n' action is meant to remind of the corresponding step command in the R "
"debugger (see <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/browser\"/>), but it is not the "
"same. The most important difference being that the code navigation, "
"described here, works on a fully static parsed representation of the script, "
"and does not attempt to follow control flow, at all. Further, a well formed "
"syntax is assumed, syntax errors will be skipped over, which may lead to "
"unexpected behavior."
msgstr ""
"Radnja „n” trebala bi podsjećati na odgovarajuću naredbu koraka u programu "
"za ispravljanje pogrešaka R-a (pogledajte <link "
"href=\"rkward://rhelp/browser\"/>), no nije ista. Najvažnija je razlika u "
"tome što ovdje opisana navigacija kroz kod radi na potpuno statičkom "
"raščlanjenom prikazu skripte i uopće ne pokušava pratiti tijek izvođenja. "
"Nadalje, pretpostavlja se ispravno oblikovana sintaksa; sintaktičke "
"pogreške preskaču se, što može dovesti do neočekivanog ponašanja."

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="Notes and Tips">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Further, what exactly is a \"statement\", and \"inner\", or and \"outer\" "
"context may not always be quite clear, and may not always correspond exactly "
"to the way the R engine sees your code. Instead, these commands are meant to "
"behave in a way, that we hope makes sense, intuitively. Remember to always "
"control, visually, what you are doing, before you hit Ctrl+Enter."
msgstr ""
"Osim toga, pojam „naredba” te „unutarnji” i „vanjski” kontekst možda neće "
"uvijek biti sasvim jasni ni potpuno odgovarati načinu na koji ih pogon R-a "
"tumači. Umjesto toga, ove bi se naredbe trebale ponašati na intuitivan i, "
"nadamo se, razumljiv način. Prije nego što pritisnete Ctrl+Enter, uvijek "
"vizualno provjerite što radite."

#. i18n: ectx: (Code Navigation and Quick Code Navigation Mode) <section title="Notes and Tips">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_code_navigation.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most commands show a tendency to move towards outer contexts, so 'n' and 'N' "
"are not exact opposites. Remember you can undo your last step using "
"Backspace, if you went past the location you were looking for."
msgstr ""
"Većina naredbi teži prelasku prema vanjskim kontekstima pa „n” i „N” nisu "
"potpune suprotnosti. Ako ste prešli traženo mjesto, posljednji korak možete "
"poništiti tipkom Backspace."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Using the RKWard R Console"
msgstr "Uporaba konzole R-a u RKWardu"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid "Describe features and settings regarding the RKWard R Console."
msgstr "Opis mogućnosti i postavki konzole R-a u RKWardu."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The console can - by default - be found at the bottom of the application "
"window. Press the tool button labeled \"R Console\" to invoke it."
msgstr ""
"Konzola se zadano nalazi pri dnu prozora aplikacije. Otvorite je klikom na "
"gumb alata „Konzola R-a”."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid "What is the console?"
msgstr "Što je konzola?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="What is the console?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard is based on the R language for statistical computing. The console "
"allows you to enter R commands directly. Obviously, to use this, you need to "
"know some basics of the R language. Select Help->Help on R for some "
"introductory information."
msgstr ""
"RKWard se temelji na jeziku R za statističko računanje. Konzola omogućuje "
"izravno unošenje naredbi R-a. Da biste je koristili, potrebno je poznavati "
"osnove jezika R. Uvodne informacije potražite u Pomoć->Pomoć za R."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="What is the console?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The console is meant for interactive use and small commands. For editing "
"complex commands / scripts, using the Script File Editor (File->New->Script "
"File) is much more comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Konzola je namijenjena interaktivnoj upotrebi i kraćim naredbama. Za "
"uređivanje složenih naredbi ili skripti mnogo je praktičnije koristiti "
"uređivač datoteka skripti (Datoteka->Novo->Datoteka skripte)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="What is the console?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:15
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Many console features are available from the context menu. To invoke the "
"context menu, click the right mouse button inside the console window."
msgstr "Mnoge su mogućnosti konzole dostupne u kontekstnom izborniku. Da biste otvorili kontekstni izbornik, kliknite desnom tipkom miša unutar prozora konzole."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid "Interrupting commands"
msgstr "Prekidanje naredbi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Interrupting commands">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To interrupt a running command, press Ctrl+C, or choose \"Interrupt running "
"command\" from the context menu. Note that the command will not necessarily "
"end immediately. If there are several other commands running at the same "
"time (e.g. some action you invoked from the Analysis menu), the console will "
"only become available again, when the R backend becomes idle."
msgstr "Da biste prekinuli naredbu koja se izvodi, pritisnite Ctrl+C ili u kontekstnom izborniku odaberite „Prekini izvođenje naredbe”. Naredba možda neće odmah završiti. Ako se istodobno izvodi još naredbi (npr. neka radnja koju ste pokrenuli iz izbornika Analiza), konzola će ponovno biti dostupna tek kada pozadinski proces R-a postane neaktivan."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Re-running selected commands"
msgstr "Ponovno pokretanje odabranih naredbi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Re-running selected commands">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:27
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To re-run (a sequence of) selected commands, select them using the mouse. "
"Then choose \"Run selection\" from the context menu (default shortcut is Ctrl"
"+Return). Leading \"> \" and \"+ \" on the selected lines will be removed "
"automatically."
msgstr "Da biste ponovno pokrenuli odabrane naredbe (ili njihov niz), odaberite ih mišem. Zatim u kontekstnom izborniku odaberite „Pokreni odabir” (zadani prečac je Ctrl+Return). Početni znakovi „> ” i „+ ” u odabranim recima automatski će se ukloniti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:31
#, kde-format
msgid "Copying commands / output"
msgstr "Kopiranje naredbi / izlaza"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Copying commands / output">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:31
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There are two copy modes available from the context menu (or the Edit menu). "
"One allows you to copy the selection literally, i.e. including the prompts "
"\"> \" and \"+ \". In contrast, \"Copy commands, only\" will remove the "
"prompts from the text copied into the clipboard."
msgstr "U kontekstnom izborniku (ili izborniku Uređivanje) dostupna su dva načina kopiranja. Jedan omogućuje doslovno kopiranje odabira, uključujući upite „> ” i „+ ”. Nasuprot tome, naredba „Kopiraj samo naredbe” uklanja upite iz teksta kopiranog u međuspremnik."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Copying commands / output">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:31
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Note that the customary shortcut for copying text - Ctrl+C - does NOT work "
"in the console, as Ctrl+C already means interrupting the current command."
msgstr "Imajte na umu da uobičajeni prečac za kopiranje teksta — Ctrl+C — NE radi u konzoli jer Ctrl+C ondje već služi za prekid trenutačne naredbe."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:37
#, kde-format
msgid "Function reference"
msgstr "Referenca funkcija"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Function reference">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:37
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Pressing F2 (or selecting \"Function reference\" from the context menu) will "
"try to look up the R help page for whichever keyword the cursor is currently "
"on."
msgstr "Pritiskom na F2 (ili odabirom „Referenca funkcija” u kontekstnom izborniku) pokušat će se pronaći stranica pomoći za R za ključnu riječ na kojoj se trenutačno nalazi pokazivač."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Navigating the command history"
msgstr "Kretanje kroz povijest naredbi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Navigating the command history">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The console provides a mechanism to recall recent commands, similar to the "
"readline functionality offered in R or most shells."
msgstr "Konzola omogućuje dohvaćanje nedavno korištenih naredbi, slično funkcionalnosti readline u R-u ili većini ljuski."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Navigating the command history">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To recall the previous command, simply press the up arrow. Press the up "
"arrow repeatedly to recall the command before that, and so on. Similarly, "
"pressing the down arrow goes downwards in the command history. Of course, "
"you can also edit a recalled command line."
msgstr "Za dohvaćanje prethodne naredbe pritisnite strelicu prema gore. Ponavljajte pritisak da biste dohvatili još starije naredbe. Strelica prema dolje pomiče se naprijed kroz povijest naredbi. Dohvaćeni redak naredbe možete i urediti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Navigating the command history">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"It is also possible to search the command history for lines starting with a "
"specified string. To use this, enter - for example - \"print\" in the "
"console. Now use Shift+Up / Shift+Down. You will note, that only those "
"recent command lines that started with \"print\" will be shown."
msgstr "Povijest naredbi možete pretražiti i po recima koji počinju zadanim nizom. Primjerice, upišite „print” u konzolu, a zatim pritisnite Shift+Up ili Shift+Down. Prikazat će se samo nedavni reci naredbi koji počinju s „print”."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Navigating the command history">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to make the second mode of searching the command history the "
"default. In this case, pressing Shift+Up/Down will navigate all commands, "
"while pressing Up/Down without the Shift key will show only matching lines. "
"(see <link href=\"#settings\">Section settings</link>)."
msgstr "Drugi način pretraživanja povijesti naredbi možete postaviti kao zadani. U tom će slučaju Shift+Up/Down prolaziti kroz sve naredbe, a Up/Down bez tipke Shift prikazivat će samo odgovarajuće retke (pogledajte <link href=\"#settings\">Postavke odjeljka</link>)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Navigating the command history">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can also save / load a command history at any time during your session, "
"using <i>File->Import / Export command history</i> or the R commands "
"<i>savehistory()</i> and <i>loadhistory()</i>."
msgstr "Povijest naredbi možete spremiti ili učitati u bilo kojem trenutku sesije pomoću mogućnosti <i>Datoteka->Uvezi / izvezi povijest naredbi</i> ili naredbi R-a <i>savehistory()</i> i <i>loadhistory()</i>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:53
#, kde-format
msgid "Filename and Object name completion"
msgstr "Dovršavanje naziva datoteka i objekata"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Filename and Object name completion">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the Tab key while typing the name of an R object will try to "
"complete the name of that R object. If several objects start with the typed "
"characters, a list of all those objects will be shown."
msgstr "Pritiskom na tipku Tab tijekom upisivanja naziva objekta R-a pokušat će se dovršiti naziv tog objekta. Ako više objekata počinje upisanim znakovima, prikazat će se njihov popis."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Filename and Object name completion">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For an example, enter \"base::pa\" in the console, then press Tab. This will "
"list all objects from package base starting with \"pa\". Now append an \"s"
"\", and press Tab again. The word will be changed to \"paste\", as that is "
"the only matching object name."
msgstr "Primjerice, u konzolu upišite „base::pa”, a zatim pritisnite Tab. Prikazat će se svi objekti iz paketa base čiji naziv počinje s „pa”. Zatim dodajte „s” i ponovno pritisnite Tab. Riječ će se promijeniti u „paste”, jer je to jedini odgovarajući naziv objekta."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Filename and Object name completion">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Based on some simple heuristics, RKWard will try to complete file names "
"instead of object names, where appropriate. This is done, when the cursor "
"seems to be inside a quoted string that does not seem to be part of an "
"object name."
msgstr "Na temelju jednostavnih heuristika, RKWard će po potrebi pokušati dovršiti nazive datoteka umjesto naziva objekata. To se događa kada se čini da je pokazivač unutar niza u navodnicima koji nije dio naziva objekta."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="...">
#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="...">
#. i18n: ectx: (Workspace Browser) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61 rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:29
#: rkward/pages/rkward_workspace_browser.rkh:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Configurable Settings"
msgstr "Postavke koje se mogu prilagoditi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To configure the behavior of the console, select <a href=\"rkward://settings/"
"console\">Settings->Configure RKWard->R Console</a> or \"Configure\" from "
"the context menu. The following options are configurable:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste prilagodili ponašanje konzole, odaberite <a "
"href=\"rkward://settings/console\">Postavke->Postavljanje RKWarda->Konzola "
"R-a</a> ili „Postavi” u kontekstnom izborniku. Možete prilagoditi sljedeće "
"mogućnosti:"

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Load/save command history</b>: Whether the <link href=\"#command_history"
"\">command history</link> is saved when closing RKWard, and reloaded when "
"next starting RKWard again. If this is not checked, each session of RKWard "
"will start out with an empty command history."
msgstr ""
"<b>Učitaj/spremi povijest naredbi</b>: određuje hoće li se <link "
"href=\"#command_history\">povijest naredbi</link> spremiti pri zatvaranju "
"RKWarda i ponovno učitati pri sljedećem pokretanju. Ako ova mogućnost nije "
"označena, svaka sesija RKWarda započet će s praznom poviješću naredbi."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Maximum length of command history</b>: Only this many lines are kept in "
"the <link href=\"#command_history\">command history</link>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Najveća duljina povijesti naredbi</b>: u <link "
"href=\"#command_history\">povijesti naredbi</link> zadržava se samo ovoliko "
"redaka."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Maximum number of paragraphs/lines to display in the console</b>: No more "
"than this many total lines (commands and output) will be shown in the "
"console. When this number of lines is exceeded, lines will be removed at the "
"top of the console window. To clear the console entirely, choose \"Clear\" "
"from the context menu or the Edit menu."
msgstr ""
"<b>Najveći broj odlomaka/redaka za prikaz u konzoli</b>: u konzoli će se "
"prikazati najviše ovoliko redaka ukupno (naredbi i izlaza). Kada se taj broj "
"prekorači, redci će se uklanjati s vrha prozora konzole. Da biste potpuno "
"očistili konzolu, odaberite „Očisti” u kontekstnom izborniku ili izborniku "
"Uredi."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Run commands from script editor through the console</b>: Commands coming "
"from script editors may be sent through the console, i.e. the commands and "
"their results will be shown in the console. If this option is not checked, "
"the commands will only be visible in the Command log, but not in the console."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pokreći naredbe iz uređivača skripti kroz konzolu</b>: naredbe iz "
"uređivača skripti mogu se slati kroz konzolu, pa će naredbe i njihovi "
"rezultati biti prikazani u konzoli. Ako ova mogućnost nije označena, naredbe "
"će biti vidljive samo u zapisniku naredbi, a ne i u konzoli."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Also add those commands to console history</b>: If the above option is "
"checked, this affects, whether such commands are also added to the console "
"history. Turning off this option may help to keep the console history \"clean"
"\"."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dodaj te naredbe i u povijest konzole</b>: ako je prethodna mogućnost "
"označena, ova određuje hoće li se takve naredbe dodati i u povijest konzole. "
"Isključivanjem ove mogućnosti povijest konzole može ostati „čista”."

#. i18n: ectx: (Using the RKWard R Console) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_console.rkh:61
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Command history is context-sensitive by default</b>: If this is checked, "
"the context-sensitive mode of navigating the <link href=\"#command_history"
"\">command history</link> is the default, i.e. available with Up/Down "
"without Shift. Else the key binding for this is Shift+Up/Down."
msgstr ""
"<b>Povijest naredbi prema zadanim je postavkama osjetljiva na kontekst</b>: "
"ako je ova mogućnost označena, zadani je način pregledavanja <link "
"href=\"#command_history\">povijesti naredbi</link> osjetljiv na kontekst, "
"odnosno dostupan tipkama sa strelicama gore/dolje bez tipke Shift. U "
"suprotnom se upotrebljavaju prečaci Shift+gore/dolje."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard for new Users"
msgstr "RKWard za nove korisnike"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Provide some starting points for users new to R and RKWard. For a more in "
"depth guide see <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_for_r_users\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ponudite početne smjernice korisnicima koji su novi u R-u i RKWardu. "
"Detaljniji vodič potražite na stranici <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_for_r_users\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Where's my data?"
msgstr "Gdje su moji podaci?"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Where's my data?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you have previously used different statistics tools, you may be "
"accustomed to the idea, that all your data is basically stored in one single "
"spreadsheet, and that spreadsheet is visible all of the time. While, of "
"course, R can deal with this sort of data (technically called a \"data.frame"
"\"), it is much more flexible, and may be slightly confusing at first."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste prije koristili druge statističke alate, možda ste navikli na to da "
"se svi podaci pohranjuju u jednoj proračunskoj tablici koja je stalno "
"vidljiva. Naravno, R može raditi s takvim podacima (tehnički nazvanima "
"„data.frame”), no mnogo je fleksibilniji pa vam se u početku može činiti "
"pomalo zbunjujućim."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Where's my data?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"R - and hence RKWard - can deal with a large number of different types of "
"data: The well known spreadsheets, but also single vectors of data (like a "
"column in a spreadsheet), so called \"list\"s of different vectors or other "
"objects that may have different lengths, single data points, etc. Even most "
"of the language itself, the functions, are stored just like data and can "
"also be edited."
msgstr ""
"R — a time i RKWard — može obrađivati velik broj različitih vrsta podataka: "
"poznate proračunske tablice, ali i pojedinačne vektore podataka (poput "
"stupca u tablici), takozvane „list” objekte koji sadrže različite vektore "
"ili druge objekte različitih duljina, pojedinačne podatkovne točke itd. "
"Čak su i većina elemenata samog jezika, odnosno funkcije, pohranjeni poput "
"podataka i mogu se uređivati."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Where's my data?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"At the same time, R is not confined to working with just one piece of data "
"at a time, but rather you have a \"Workspace\", where all your different "
"variables, tables, etc. are accessible. You can have many data.frames at "
"once, and additional data of other types. At the left side of the "
"application window, there should be an icon labelled \"Workspace\". You can "
"click on this to see all the objects present in your workspace. All the "
"objects you create or modify will be visible inside the \".GlobalEnv\". Most "
"other objects are predefined in libraries, such as \"package:base\". See "
"<link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_workspace_browser\"/> for details."
msgstr ""
"Istodobno, R nije ograničen na rad samo s jednim skupom podataka, već imate "
"„radni prostor” u kojem su dostupne sve vaše različite varijable, tablice "
"itd. Možete istodobno imati više objekata data.frame i dodatne podatke "
"drugih vrsta. Na lijevoj strani prozora aplikacije trebala bi se nalaziti "
"ikona „Radni prostor”. Kliknite je da biste vidjeli sve objekte u radnom "
"prostoru. Svi objekti koje izradite ili izmijenite bit će vidljivi unutar "
"„.GlobalEnv”. Većina ostalih objekata unaprijed je definirana u bibliotekama, "
"primjerice u „package:base”. Pojedinosti potražite na stranici <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_workspace_browser\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Where's my data?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not need to worry about all these details. To create a new "
"spreadsheet (data.frame), choose File->New->Dataset from the menu. All you "
"need to do is to assign a name to this table, then you can start editing. To "
"work with pre-existing data, pick the appropriate option from the File-"
">Import menu."
msgstr ""
"Ne morate se brinuti o svim tim pojedinostima. Da biste izradili novu "
"proračunsku tablicu (data.frame), u izborniku odaberite Datoteka->Novo->Skup "
"podataka. Trebate samo dodijeliti naziv toj tablici, a zatim možete početi "
"uređivati. Za rad s postojećim podacima odaberite odgovarajuću mogućnost u "
"izborniku Datoteka->Uvoz."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid "How can I make use of my results in an external application?"
msgstr "Kako mogu koristiti rezultate u vanjskoj aplikaciji?"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="How can I make use of my results in an external application?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In this section you will learn about some basic methods how to make use of "
"your results in external applications."
msgstr ""
"U ovom ćete odjeljku naučiti neke osnovne načine korištenja rezultata u "
"vanjskim aplikacijama."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="How can I make use of my results in an external application?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Suppose you produced a textual output from tests you performed. Such will be "
"presented in the \"output window\" of RKWard. It's easy to keep track on "
"your work since a standard of RKWard is to show everything in chronological "
"order together with the date of creation."
msgstr ""
"Pretpostavimo da ste iz provedenih testova dobili tekstualni izlaz. On će "
"se prikazati u „prozoru izlaza” RKWarda. Svoj rad možete jednostavno "
"pratiti jer RKWard prema zadanim postavkama sve prikazuje kronološkim "
"redoslijedom, zajedno s datumom stvaranja."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="How can I make use of my results in an external application?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:23
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"See <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/> for details on working with "
"the output. The easiest method of reusing the output is to select the "
"relevant portion, and copy and paste them to an office suite."
msgstr ""
"Pojedinosti o radu s izlazom potražite na stranici <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/>. Najlakše ćete ponovno upotrijebiti "
"izlaz tako da odaberete željeni dio, kopirate ga i zalijepite u uredski paket."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Basic Analyses"
msgstr "Osnovne analize"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Basic Analyses">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In order to familiarize yourself with RKWard (or with your data), one of the "
"first things to do might be to choose Analysis->Descriptive Statistics from "
"the Menu. You will be presented with a dialog that allows you to select one "
"or more variables to analyse. This looks similar to the workspace browser "
"introduced above. On the additional tabs you can choose which types of "
"descriptive statistics should be calculated."
msgstr ""
"Da biste se upoznali s RKWardom (ili svojim podacima), za početak u "
"izborniku odaberite Analiza->Deskriptivna statistika. Otvorit će se dijalog "
"u kojem možete odabrati jednu ili više varijabli za analizu. Izgledom "
"nalikuje prethodno opisanom pregledniku radnog prostora. Na dodatnim "
"karticama možete odabrati vrste deskriptivne statistike koje želite izračunati."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Basic Analyses">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"At the lower right of the dialog, there is a button labelled \"Code\". Using "
"this, you can show/hide a text area. If you look at the contents of this "
"text area (you may have to resize the window to view it more comfortably), "
"you can see the text changing according to the settings you choose in the "
"dialog. This text is actually R syntax. It is the code that is needed to "
"perform these calculations in R. Most of RKWard is based on generating this "
"code for you, and then running it inside R. Later, when you feel more "
"comfortable, have specific needs not covered by RKWard, or you want to "
"automate repetitive tasks, you can use this syntax to literally program your "
"analyses. Note that the code is divided into up to three sections: "
"\"Preprocess\" for loading required libraries or defining helper functions, "
"\"Calculate\" to perform the actual calculations, and \"Printout\" to "
"generate output in RKWard's output window."
msgstr ""
"U donjem desnom kutu dijaloga nalazi se gumb „Kod”. Njime možete prikazati "
"ili sakriti tekstno područje. Ako pogledate njegov sadržaj (možda ćete "
"morati promijeniti veličinu prozora radi lakšeg pregleda), vidjet ćete da "
"se tekst mijenja ovisno o postavkama koje odaberete u dijalogu. Taj je "
"tekst zapravo sintaksa jezika R, odnosno kod potreban za obavljanje "
"izračuna u R-u. Većina RKWarda temelji se na tome da za vas generira taj "
"kod i zatim ga pokrene u R-u. Kasnije, kada se bolje upoznate s programom, "
"ako imate posebne potrebe koje RKWard ne pokriva ili želite automatizirati "
"ponavljajuće zadatke, tom se sintaksom možete poslužiti za programiranje "
"analiza. Imajte na umu da se kod može podijeliti u najviše tri odjeljka: "
"„Preprocess” za učitavanje potrebnih biblioteka ili definiranje pomoćnih "
"funkcija, „Calculate” za same izračune i „Printout” za stvaranje izlaza u "
"prozoru izlaza RKWarda."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="Basic Analyses">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For now, just click submit, once you've made your choices, and watch the "
"results show up in a new window."
msgstr ""
"Za sada, nakon što odaberete željene mogućnosti, samo kliknite „Pošalji” i "
"rezultati će se prikazati u novom prozoru."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid "So much more"
msgstr "I još mnogo toga"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="So much more">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The purpose of RKWard is to make the power of the R language easily "
"accessible to the user, without having to learn a full programming language, "
"first. However, for advanced needs, you may want to make use of the full "
"flexibility of the R language. RKWard offers a lot of tools to make this "
"easier, both for users new to R, and R experts. Read on in <link href="
"\"rkward://page/rkward_for_r_users\"/> for more on this."
msgstr ""
"Svrha je RKWarda korisnicima olakšati pristup mogućnostima jezika R, bez "
"potrebe da najprije nauče čitav programski jezik. Ipak, za naprednije "
"potrebe možda ćete htjeti iskoristiti punu fleksibilnost jezika R. RKWard "
"nudi brojne alate koji to olakšavaju i početnicima u R-u i stručnjacima. "
"Više o tome pročitajte na stranici <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_for_r_users\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for new Users) <section title="So much more">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_new_users.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Also, you may want to select Help->Help on R from the menu for some starting "
"points in learning R."
msgstr ""
"Osim toga, u izborniku možete odabrati Pomoć->Pomoć za R kako biste dobili "
"nekoliko polazišnih smjernica za učenje jezika R."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard for R Users"
msgstr "RKWard za korisnike R-a"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Briefly explains the main components of RKWard, assuming the user is already "
"familiar with basic concepts of R."
msgstr ""
"Ukratko objašnjava glavne sastavnice RKWarda, uz pretpostavku da je korisnik "
"već upoznat s osnovnim pojmovima jezika R."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid "The Console"
msgstr "Konzola"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"First things first: An emulation of the standard R console can be found at "
"the bottom on the screen. There you will notice several buttons, one of "
"which is labelled \"R Console\" and has a console icon."
msgstr ""
"Najprije: emulaciju standardne konzole R-a pronaći ćete pri dnu zaslona. "
"Ondje se nalazi nekoliko gumba, od kojih je jedan označen „Konzola R-a” i "
"ima ikonu konzole."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This console works almost exactly like the regular R text console, so you "
"can start working right away. Differences include:"
msgstr ""
"Ova konzola radi gotovo jednako kao uobičajena tekstna konzola R-a pa "
"možete odmah početi raditi. Razlike uključuju:"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Syntax highlighting"
msgstr "Isticanje sintakse"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"While typing function calls, a list of arguments to that function is shown "
"in a box (argument hinting)"
msgstr ""
"Tijekom upisivanja poziva funkcije u okviru se prikazuje popis njezinih "
"argumenata (savjeti za argumente)."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"While the cursor is on an R symbol or function, pressing F2 will search the "
"R help for that symbol. Also available from the Help menu, or the right "
"mouse button menu"
msgstr ""
"Dok je pokazivač na simbolu ili funkciji jezika R, pritiskom na F2 "
"pretražuje se pomoć za taj simbol. Ta je mogućnost dostupna i u izborniku "
"Pomoć te u kontekstnom izborniku desnom tipkom miša."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can easily create a transcript of the commands you run in the console "
"using Run->CC commands to output..."
msgstr ""
"Zapis naredbi pokrenutih u konzoli možete jednostavno izraditi pomoću "
"mogućnosti Pokreni->Kopiraj naredbe u izlaz..."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="The Console">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid "See <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_console\"/> for more details."
msgstr "Dodatne pojedinosti potražite na stranici <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_console\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:26
#, kde-format
msgid "Script Editors"
msgstr "Uređivači skripti"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Script Editors">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Often it is more convenient to write scripts in a separate file, instead of "
"typing them directly in the console. To open a new script editor (with "
"syntax highlighting, and many more features), choose File->New->Script File, "
"or open an already existing Script file using File->Open R Script File."
msgstr ""
"Često je praktičnije pisati skripte u zasebnoj datoteci nego ih izravno "
"upisivati u konzolu. Da biste otvorili novi uređivač skripti (s isticanjem "
"sintakse i brojnim drugim značajkama), odaberite Datoteka->Novo->Datoteka "
"skripte ili postojeću skriptu otvorite pomoću Datoteka->Otvori datoteku "
"skripte R-a."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Script Editors">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You will note that the editor opens in a new window in the main workplace "
"(the area of the window, that you are most likely reading this text, in). "
"You can open any number of script editor windows at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Uređivač će se otvoriti u novom prozoru glavnog radnog prostora (području "
"prozora u kojem vjerojatno čitate ovaj tekst). Istodobno možete otvoriti "
"koliko god prozora uređivača skripti želite."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Script Editors">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To run the code in a script editor window, either copy and paste it to the "
"console, or choose one of the actions in the Run menu, such as Run All or "
"Run Selection. Note: The contents of the menus may change according to the "
"type of active window. Hence, if you look at the Run menu while reading "
"this, there will be no entries."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pokrenuli kod u prozoru uređivača skripti, kopirajte ga i zalijepite "
"u konzolu ili odaberite neku od radnji u izborniku Pokreni, primjerice "
"Pokreni sve ili Pokreni odabir. Napomena: sadržaj izbornika može se "
"mijenjati ovisno o vrsti aktivnog prozora. Zato izbornik Pokreni možda neće "
"sadržavati stavke dok čitate ovaj tekst."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Workspace View"
msgstr "Prikaz radnog prostora"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Workspace View">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard comes with a \"workspace view\" or \"object browser\". By default "
"this is available by clicking on \"Workspace\" on the left side of the "
"application window. This allows you to examine and manipulate all objects in "
"the R workspace. By default, only the \".GlobalEnv\" environment is shown "
"(where you'll typically do your work; see <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/."
"GlobalEnv\"/>). But, checking \"Show All Environments\", you can easily "
"explore data and functions in loaded R libraries (and even in package "
"namespaces)."
msgstr ""
"RKWard sadrži „prikaz radnog prostora” odnosno „preglednik objekata”. "
"Prema zadanim postavkama dostupan je klikom na „Radni prostor” na lijevoj "
"strani prozora aplikacije. Omogućuje pregled i upravljanje svim objektima u "
"radnom prostoru R-a. Zadano se prikazuje samo okruženje „.GlobalEnv” (u "
"kojem ćete obično raditi; pogledajte <link "
"href=\"rkward://rhelp/.GlobalEnv\"/>). Ako označite „Prikaži sva okruženja”, "
"možete jednostavno pregledati podatke i funkcije u učitanim bibliotekama "
"R-a (pa čak i u prostorima naziva paketa)."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Workspace View">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The object browser provides function to select which types of object are "
"shown (on the top). Hovering the mouse over an item will show some "
"additional information on the symbol. Right-clicking on an item will show "
"available actions. See <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_workspace_browser\"/"
"> for details."
msgstr ""
"Preglednik objekata omogućuje odabir vrsta objekata koje će prikazivati "
"(pri vrhu). Zadržite pokazivač iznad stavke da biste vidjeli dodatne "
"informacije o simbolu. Desnom tipkom miša kliknite stavku da biste vidjeli "
"dostupne radnje. Pojedinosti potražite na stranici <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_workspace_browser\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid "R Help"
msgstr "Pomoć za R"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="R Help">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"By default R help pages are shown as HTML, inside RKWard. You can invoke the "
"help in the usual way by running e.g. \"?print\" or \"help (print)\" or "
"\"help.start ()\" in the console. Additionally, there is a tool window to "
"search your installed R help pages. This is accessible using a button "
"located at the bottom of the window (next to the console button). To view a "
"help page found using this tool, double-click on it."
msgstr ""
"Zadano se stranice pomoći za R prikazuju kao HTML unutar RKWarda. Pomoć "
"možete otvoriti na uobičajen način tako da u konzoli pokrenete, primjerice, "
"„?print”, „help (print)” ili „help.start ()”. Osim toga, postoji prozor alata "
"za pretraživanje instaliranih stranica pomoći za R. Dostupan je putem gumba "
"pri dnu prozora (pokraj gumba konzole). Da biste otvorili pronađenu stranicu "
"pomoći, dvaput je kliknite."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid "Managing installed and loaded Libraries"
msgstr "Upravljanje instaliranim i učitanim bibliotekama"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Managing installed and loaded Libraries">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:41
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard provides an advanced dialog to have installation, updating, and "
"loading of packages. This is available from Settings->Manage R Packages."
msgstr "RKWard nudi napredni dijalog za instalaciju, ažuriranje i učitavanje paketa. Dostupan je u odjeljku Postavke->Upravljanje paketima za R."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Window management"
msgstr "Upravljanje prozorima"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Window management">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"All windows shown in the main view area can be detached to a separate top "
"level window using Windows->Detach. Similarly, detached windows can be "
"attached to the main workplace using Window->Attach to main window."
msgstr "Svi prozori prikazani u glavnom području prikaza mogu se odvojiti u zasebne prozore najviše razine naredbom Prozor->Odvoji. Slično tome, odvojene prozore možete priključiti glavnom radnom prostoru naredbom Prozor->Priključi glavnom prozoru."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Window management">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Windows can be closed using Windows->Close (Ctrl+W by default). Ctrl+Tab and "
"Ctrl+Shift+Tab cycle through all active document / tool windows in your "
"session."
msgstr "Prozore možete zatvoriti naredbom Prozor->Zatvori (zadano Ctrl+W). Kombinacijama Ctrl+Tab i Ctrl+Shift+Tab možete kružiti kroz sve aktivne prozore dokumenata i alata u sesiji."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Window management">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Tool windows (e.g. the R Console) can be detached and re-attached using the "
"arrow-icon in their window border."
msgstr "Prozore alata (npr. konzolu R-a) možete odvojiti i ponovno priključiti pomoću ikone strelice na rubu prozora."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid "Editing data"
msgstr "Uređivanje podataka"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Editing data">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard provides a built-in editor for data.frames. In fact, you can edit "
"many data.frames at the same time, and even while running lengthy "
"calculations. Still the data is stored as a regular data.frame in R. To "
"explore the data editor, either choose File->New->Dataset, or right-click a "
"data.frame in the Workspace browser, and choose Edit from the menu."
msgstr "RKWard ima ugrađeni uređivač za objekte data.frame. Možete uređivati više objekata data.frame istodobno, čak i dok se izvode dugotrajni izračuni. Podaci se i dalje pohranjuju kao obični objekti data.frame u R-u. Da biste isprobali uređivač podataka, odaberite Datoteka->Novo->Skup podataka ili desnom tipkom miša kliknite objekt data.frame u pregledniku radnog prostora pa u izborniku odaberite Uredi."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Editing data">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Support for adding other types of data, esp. single vectors is planned, but "
"not currently supported."
msgstr "Podrška za dodavanje drugih vrsta podataka, osobito pojedinačnih vektora, planirana je, ali trenutačno nije dostupna."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:56
#, kde-format
msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "Grafika"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Graphics">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:56
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"R has a few immensely powerful graphics systems (although not interactive) "
"provided by various packages such as <b>graphics</b> and <b>lattice</b>. "
"RKWard wraps around the standard platform-dependent screen device to provide "
"a uniform experience. In additional to the standard functionality of these "
"packages, RKWard provides a screen device history mechanism to store and "
"browse your plots. See <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_plot_history\"/> "
"for details."
msgstr "R ima nekoliko vrlo moćnih grafičkih sustava (iako nisu interaktivni), koje pružaju razni paketi poput <b>graphics</b> i <b>lattice</b>. RKWard obuhvaća standardni zaslonski uređaj ovisan o platformi kako bi pružio ujednačeno iskustvo. Uz uobičajene mogućnosti tih paketa, RKWard nudi i mehanizam povijesti zaslonskog uređaja za pohranu i pregled grafikona. Pojedinosti potražite na stranici <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_plot_history\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:59
#, kde-format
msgid "Utility functions"
msgstr "Pomoćne funkcije"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Utility functions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard provides various utility functions which are listed in the index of "
"the <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/rkward-package\">rkward package overview</"
"link>."
msgstr "RKWard nudi razne pomoćne funkcije navedene u kazalu <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/rkward-package\">pregleda paketa rkward</link>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Everything else"
msgstr "Sve ostalo"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Everything else">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You will notice that RKWard provides a lot of further menu options. These "
"provide access to functionality in R. In fact, they do so by generating R "
"syntax from settings made in a graphical dialog. For instance, select "
"Analysis->Descriptive Statistics. You will notice a small window at the "
"bottom (can be toggled on or off using the \"Code\" button) that contains "
"the R code needed to generate these statistics. This way, even if you prefer "
"to script your code by hand, you can use dialogs to gain usage examples or "
"snippets of code for functions you are less familiar with in R."
msgstr "Primijetit ćete da RKWard nudi još mnogo mogućnosti izbornika. One omogućuju pristup funkcijama R-a, tako što iz postavki grafičkog dijaloga generiraju sintaksu R-a. Primjerice, odaberite Analiza->Deskriptivna statistika. Pri dnu ćete vidjeti mali prozor (možete ga prikazati ili sakriti gumbom „Kod”) sa sintaksom R-a potrebnom za izračun statistika. Tako možete koristiti dijaloge za primjere upotrebe ili isječke koda za funkcije R-a koje slabije poznajete, čak i ako radije pišete skripte ručno."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <section title="Everything else">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Also, all commands that are executed get shown in the Command Log, available "
"as a tool window next to the R Console."
msgstr "Osim toga, sve izvršene naredbe prikazuju se u zapisniku naredbi, dostupnom kao prozor alata pokraj konzole R-a."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard for R Users) <related>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_for_r_users.rkh:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_for_new_users\"/> For an introduction to "
"some more basic concepts"
msgstr "<link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_for_new_users\"/> Uvod u neke osnovne pojmove"

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Version incompatibilities"
msgstr "Nekompatibilnosti inačica"

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"While RKWard tries to support a large number of different R versions, some "
"of the time, a new version of R will not be compatible with RKWard out of "
"the box. In these cases you will have to install a new version of RKWard. "
"Quite often, this does not actually have to be a <i>new</i> version, but "
"simply one that was compiled against your new version of R."
msgstr "Iako RKWard nastoji podržati velik broj različitih inačica R-a, nova inačica R-a ponekad neće odmah biti kompatibilna s RKWardom. U tom ćete slučaju morati instalirati novu inačicu RKWarda. Često to ne mora biti <i>nova</i> inačica, već samo ona koja je prevedena za vašu novu inačicu R-a."

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you have installed RKWard using the package manager of your Linux "
"distribution, but no updated package is available, please contact your "
"distribution maintainer or file a bug report, there."
msgstr "Ako ste instalirali RKWard pomoću upravitelja paketa svoje distribucije Linuxa, ali ažurirani paket nije dostupan, obratite se održavatelju distribucije ili ondje prijavite grešku."

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For more information about available versions, and more troubleshooting "
"information, see <link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org\">the project homepage</"
"link>."
msgstr "Više informacija o dostupnim inačicama i rješavanju problema potražite na <link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org\">početnoj stranici projekta</link>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid "Graphics Engine Version Mismatch"
msgstr "Nepodudaranje inačice grafičkog pogona"

#. i18n: ectx: (Version incompatibilities) <section title="Graphics Engine Version Mismatch">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_incompatible_version.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the most common kind of version incompatibility. The same advice "
"applies as above, i.e. please install an updated version of RKWard. However, "
"if no update appears to be immediately available, and you are desparate to "
"continue working, set <link href=\"rkward://settings/graphics\">Settings-&gt;"
"Onscreen Graphics</link>-&gt;\"Integration of R standard device\" to \"No "
"integration\". Then you can use the vanille onscreen devices (X11() or "
"Windows() or Quartz()), for plotting."
msgstr "Ovo je najčešća vrsta nekompatibilnosti inačica. Primjenjuje se isti savjet kao i gore: instalirajte ažuriranu inačicu RKWarda. No ako ažuriranje još nije dostupno, a želite odmah nastaviti s radom, u odjeljku <link href=\"rkward://settings/graphics\">Postavke-&gt;Zaslonska grafika</link>-&gt;„Integracija standardnog uređaja R-a” odaberite „Bez integracije”. Zatim za crtanje možete koristiti uobičajene zaslonske uređaje (X11(), Windows() ili Quartz())."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard Output"
msgstr "Izlaz RKWarda"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The RKWard output window, or, more generally, RKWard output files (.rko) are "
"intended as an easy way to keep a log of the work on your data. By default, "
"one output file is always available. Depending on your configuration (<link "
"href=\"rkward://settings/output\">Settings->Configure RKWard->Output</"
"link>), this output file may or may not be shared across different "
"workspaces."
msgstr "Prozor izlaza RKWarda, odnosno općenito izlazne datoteke RKWarda (.rko), služe kao jednostavan način bilježenja rada s podacima. Zadano je uvijek dostupna jedna izlazna datoteka. Ovisno o konfiguraciji (<link href=\"rkward://settings/output\">Postavke->Konfiguriraj RKWard->Izlaz</link>), ta se datoteka može, ali i ne mora dijeliti između različitih radnih prostora."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard output can be saved and opened like regular files. To direct output "
"to a specific output file, you will have to \"activate\" it. Closing an "
"output window does not discard the modifications, but on closing RKWard you "
"will be prompted to save (or discard) any pending changes."
msgstr "Izlaz RKWarda možete spremati i otvarati kao obične datoteke. Da biste usmjerili izlaz u određenu datoteku, morate je „aktivirati”. Zatvaranjem prozora izlaza izmjene se ne odbacuju, no pri zatvaranju RKWard će vas upitati želite li spremiti ili odbaciti promjene na čekanju."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid "Producing RKWard output from R"
msgstr "Stvaranje izlaza RKWarda iz R-a"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="Producing RKWard output from R">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To write to the active RKWard output file from custom R code, refer to <link "
"href=\"rkward://rhelp/rk.print\"/>, and the functions linked from there."
msgstr "Za zapisivanje u aktivnu izlaznu datoteku RKWarda iz prilagođenog koda R-a pogledajte <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/rk.print\"/> i funkcije povezane s te stranice."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="Producing RKWard output from R">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To load / save / switch between output files, etc., refer to <link href="
"\"rkward://rhelp/rk.output\"/>."
msgstr "Za učitavanje i spremanje izlaznih datoteka, prebacivanje među njima i druge radnje pogledajte <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/rk.output\"/>."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Using the output in an office suite"
msgstr "Korištenje izlaza u uredskom paketu"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="Using the output in an office suite">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get output into your office suite, is to first select the "
"relevant portions, copy them (Edit->Copy), then paste them. This works well, "
"at least in OpenOffice or LibreOffice. You can also drag and drop images "
"from the output to an OpenOffice or LibreOffice document."
msgstr "Najlakše ćete prenijeti izlaz u uredski paket tako da najprije odaberete željene dijelove, kopirate ih (Uredi->Kopiraj), a zatim zalijepite. To dobro funkcionira barem u OpenOfficeu i LibreOfficeu. Slike možete i povući iz izlaza u dokument OpenOfficea ili LibreOfficea."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="Using the output in an office suite">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Internally, RKWard output files are currently simply based on HTML. If you "
"need access to the raw HTML and image files, a .rko-file is just a zip'ed "
"folder. You can unzip it using standard tools, or open it in RKWard, and "
"retrieve the files from the \".rkward\" of your home directory (location "
"configurable in Settings->Configure RKWard->General)."
msgstr "Izlazne datoteke RKWarda trenutačno se temelje na HTML-u. Ako trebate pristup izvornim HTML datotekama i slikama, datoteka .rko zapravo je komprimirana mapa. Možete je raspakirati uobičajenim alatima ili je otvoriti u RKWardu i preuzeti datoteke iz mape „.rkward” u svojoj osobnoj mapi (njezino mjesto možete promijeniti u Postavke->Konfiguriraj RKWard->Općenito)."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:28
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard output vs. R Markdown"
msgstr "Izlaz RKWarda i R Markdown"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Output) <section title="RKWard output vs. R Markdown">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_output.rkh:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard also assists you in writing RMarkdown (Rmd) documents. In particular "
"there is a powerful preview feature for .Rmd scripts. While RMarkdown is "
"great for writing interactive \"reports\", the RKWard Output is very easy to "
"use for ad-hoc documentation while exploring your data."
msgstr "RKWard vam pomaže i pri pisanju dokumenata RMarkdown (Rmd). Posebno je korisna napredna mogućnost pretpregleda skripti .Rmd. RMarkdown je odličan za izradu interaktivnih „izvješća”, dok je izlaz RKWarda vrlo jednostavan za ad hoc dokumentiranje tijekom istraživanja podataka."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Screen device history"
msgstr "Povijest zaslonskog uređaja"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:10
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The screen device history provides an interface to flip through your plots, "
"similar a web browser. The current implementation understands most function "
"calls from the graphics and lattice packages. Adding other graphical engines "
"is planned for future. See the Technical Details section below for more "
"information."
msgstr "Povijest zaslonskog uređaja omogućuje pregledavanje grafikona, slično kao u web-pregledniku. Trenutačna implementacija prepoznaje većinu poziva funkcija iz paketa graphics i lattice. Podrška za druge grafičke pogone planirana je za budućnost. Više informacija potražite u odjeljku Tehničke pojedinosti u nastavku."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:10
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The screen device history is only accessible from an open screen device, "
"under the <i>History</i> menu. It is available on most screen device "
"windows. Such devices are called \"managed\" devices for the purpose of this "
"help page. File devices, such as png, pdf, etc. are not, obviously, affected "
"by this screen history implementation, and hence they are not managed. In "
"addition, \"preview\" devices, which are available on some of the plugins "
"are not managed either."
msgstr "Povijest zaslonskog uređaja dostupna je samo iz otvorenog zaslonskog uređaja, u izborniku <i>Povijest</i>. Dostupna je u većini prozora zaslonskih uređaja. U ovoj se stranici pomoći takvi uređaji nazivaju „upravljanima”. Datotečni uređaji poput png-a i pdf-a nisu obuhvaćeni ovom implementacijom povijesti zaslona pa se ne smatraju upravljanima. Upravljani nisu ni uređaji „pretpregleda” dostupni u nekim dodacima."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="...">
#. i18n: ectx: (Workspace Browser) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#: rkward/pages/rkward_workspace_browser.rkh:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Available actions"
msgstr "Dostupne radnje"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Several actions are available either from the <i>History</i> menu or from "
"the toolbar icons on a managed device. The displayed icons on the toolbar "
"can be configured from the device window's Settings->Configure Toolbars menu "
"item."
msgstr "Nekoliko je radnji dostupno u izborniku <i>Povijest</i> ili putem ikona alatne trake upravljanog uređaja. Prikazane ikone možete konfigurirati u prozoru uređaja, putem stavke izbornika Postavke->Konfiguriraj alatne trake."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Go to plot</b>: This provides a drop-down list of _all_ the plots stored "
"in the history; giving an easily accessible \"jumping\" action. RKWard tries "
"hard to identify the appropriate plot calls, but this is not always "
"feasible. In such cases a further attempt is made to identify the <i>X "
"label</i>, <i>Y label</i> and the <i>Main</i> titles of the plot and the "
"displayed string looks like \"<b>X:</b> <i>xlab</i>; <b>Y:</b> <i>ylab</i>; "
"<i>main</i>\". Sometimes even that is not possible (indicated by <b>&lt;"
"Unknown&gt;</b>). Plots which are pending to be saved are indicated by "
"<b>&lt;Unsaved plot&gt;</b>. The displayed strings are prepended with their "
"corresponding position in the history. For the usual \"linear browsing\" see "
"first / previous / next / last actions below."
msgstr "<b>Prijeđi na grafikon</b>: Prikazuje padajući popis _svih_ grafikona spremljenih u povijesti i omogućuje jednostavan „skok” na odabrani grafikon. RKWard nastoji prepoznati odgovarajuće pozive za crtanje, no to nije uvijek moguće. U tom slučaju pokušava prepoznati oznake <i>X</i> i <i>Y</i> te naslov <i>Main</i> grafikona; prikazani niz tada izgleda ovako: „<b>X:</b> <i>xlab</i>; <b>Y:</b> <i>ylab</i>; <i>main</i>”. Ponekad nije moguće ni to (što označava <b>&lt;Nepoznato&gt;</b>). Grafikoni koji čekaju spremanje označeni su s <b>&lt;Nespremljeni grafikon&gt;</b>. Ispred svakog prikazanog niza nalazi se njegov položaj u povijesti. Za uobičajeno „linearno pregledavanje” pogledajte radnje za prvi, prethodni, sljedeći i posljednji grafikon u nastavku."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>First, Previous, Next, and Last plot</b>: Obvious browsing (or replaying) "
"actions. These will try to save any unsaved/pending plot before displaying/"
"replaying the intended (first / previous / next / last) plot. This should be "
"very helpful for browsing to an already stored in the history and update it. "
"For example, a base graphics plot modified by, say, <code>abline(h=0, v=0)</"
"code> will automatically get stored \"in-place\" in the history."
msgstr "<b>Prvi, prethodni, sljedeći i posljednji grafikon</b>: Uobičajene radnje pregledavanja (ili ponovnog prikaza). Prije prikaza ili ponovnog iscrtavanja željenog (prvog, prethodnog, sljedećeg ili posljednjeg) grafikona pokušat će spremiti svaki nespremljeni grafikon ili onaj koji čeka spremanje. To je korisno za pronalaženje grafikona koji je već spremljen u povijesti i njegovo ažuriranje. Primjerice, grafikon paketa graphics koji se izmijeni naredbom <code>abline(h=0, v=0)</code> automatski će se spremiti na isto mjesto u povijesti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Append this plot</b>: This action is provided to forcefully append the "
"displayed plot to the end of the history, irrespective of its status "
"(saved / unsaved) and type (graphics / lattice / ...). In cases when a plot "
"does not automatically get stored in the history, this action should come in "
"handy. But this flexibility comes at the cost of not being able to identify "
"the plot call."
msgstr "<b>Dodaj ovaj grafikon</b>: Ova radnja prisilno dodaje prikazani grafikon na kraj povijesti, bez obzira na njegov status (spremljen/nespremljen) i vrstu (graphics/lattice/...). Korisna je kada se grafikon ne sprema automatski u povijest. Ta fleksibilnost ima cijenu: nije moguće prepoznati poziv kojim je grafikon iscrtan."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Remove this plot</b>: This will remove the currently displayed from the "
"history (if it is stored) and replay the next \"available\" plot. When "
"multiple devices are displaying the same plot (to be precise, same position "
"in the history), then removing a plot from one device will not remove it "
"from other devices; instead it will set the status of this plot on the other "
"devices as new / pending. Thus, if you happen to remove one by mistake, and "
"if it happens to be displayed on a second device, then you can re-add it to "
"the history from the second device."
msgstr "<b>Ukloni ovaj grafikon</b>: Uklanja trenutačno prikazani grafikon iz povijesti (ako je ondje spremljen) i ponovno prikazuje sljedeći „dostupni” grafikon. Ako više uređaja prikazuje isti grafikon (točnije, isti položaj u povijesti), njegovo uklanjanje na jednom uređaju neće ga ukloniti s ostalih; umjesto toga, na tim će uređajima njegov status postaviti na novi/na čekanju. Zato, ako ga slučajno uklonite, a prikazan je na drugom uređaju, možete ga s tog uređaja ponovno dodati u povijest."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Clear history</b>: As the name suggests, this action will clear the "
"plotting history. But the plots currently displayed on the devices, upon "
"further action, will get added back to the history. To completely reset the "
"screen device history close all open devices and call <code>rk.clear.plot."
"history()</code>"
msgstr "<b>Očisti povijest</b>: Kao što naziv kaže, ovom se radnjom briše povijest grafikona. Međutim, grafikoni koji su trenutačno prikazani na uređajima ponovno će se dodati u povijest pri sljedećoj radnji. Da biste u potpunosti ponovno postavili povijest zaslonskog uređaja, zatvorite sve otvorene uređaje i pozovite <code>rk.clear.plot.history()</code>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Available actions">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Plot properties</b>: This shows some additional information such as the "
"size of the displayed plot as stored in the memory, the position of the "
"current plot in the history, and, whenever possible the complete plot call."
msgstr "<b>Svojstva grafikona</b>: Prikazuje dodatne podatke, poput veličine prikazanog grafikona u memoriji, njegova položaja u povijesti i, kada je moguće, potpunog poziva za crtanje."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:29
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some default settings for the Screen device history can be configured from "
"<a href=\"rkward://settings/graphics\">Settings->Configure RKWard->Onscreen "
"Graphics</a>:"
msgstr "Neke zadane postavke povijesti zaslonskog uređaja možete konfigurirati u odjeljku <a href=\"rkward://settings/graphics\">Postavke->Konfiguriraj RKWard->Zaslonska grafika</a>:"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:29
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Screen device history</b>: Enables / disables the recording of plots "
"globally. You can toggle this from within a running RKWard session, which "
"will affect all currently open and future screen devices. When unchecked, "
"RKWard will not store any further plots in the history; although, the ones "
"already stored are not lost! You can access the stored plots by re-enabling "
"this. When toggling this, RKWard tries to save any unsaved plots, but be "
"careful especially when the maximum history length is small (see below). You "
"may want to disable this when the implemented history behavior seems non-"
"intuitive or when dealing with large plots."
msgstr "<b>Povijest zaslonskog uređaja</b>: Globalno uključuje ili isključuje bilježenje grafikona. To možete promijeniti tijekom rada RKWarda, a postavka će utjecati na sve trenutačno otvorene i buduće zaslonske uređaje. Ako je mogućnost isključena, RKWard više neće spremati grafikone u povijest, ali već spremljeni grafikoni neće se izgubiti. Ponovno ih možete pregledati tako da uključite ovu mogućnost. Pri promjeni postavke RKWard pokušava spremiti nespremljene grafikone, no budite oprezni, osobito ako je najveća duljina povijesti mala (pogledajte u nastavku). Možda ćete je htjeti isključiti ako vam se ponašanje povijesti čini neintuitivnim ili ako radite s velikim grafikonima."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:29
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Maximum number of recorded plots</b>: Controls the maximum number of "
"plots that can be stored in the history. When this limit is reached, plots "
"from the beginning of the history will get removed one by one, much like a "
"push-pop stack. A warning dialog is shown when this happens. Be careful when "
"setting this below the number of already stored plots. In that case an "
"appropriate number of plots from the beginning of the history stack will get "
"removed, which may not be desirable."
msgstr "<b>Najveći broj zabilježenih grafikona</b>: Određuje koliko se najviše grafikona može spremiti u povijest. Kada se dosegne ograničenje, grafikoni s početka povijesti uklanjaju se jedan po jedan, poput stoga. Tada se prikazuje dijalog upozorenja. Pazite da ovu vrijednost ne postavite ispod broja već spremljenih grafikona jer će se u tom slučaju ukloniti odgovarajući broj grafikona s početka povijesti, što možda ne želite."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Configurable Settings">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:29
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Maximum size of a single recorded plot</b>: Controls the maximum allowed "
"size (in KB) of a single plot that can be stored in the history. For a plot "
"larger than this specified size, a dialog box, to save or to ignore the "
"plot, will be presented. Unlike the above length restriction, this setting "
"will affect only the future plots (that is, will not remove any already "
"stored, yet large, plots)."
msgstr "<b>Najveća veličina pojedinog zabilježenog grafikona</b>: Određuje najveću dopuštenu veličinu (u KB) grafikona koji se može spremiti u povijest. Za veći će se grafikon prikazati dijalog u kojem ga možete spremiti ili zanemariti. Za razliku od prethodnog ograničenja duljine, ova postavka utječe samo na buduće grafikone i neće ukloniti već spremljene velike grafikone."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid "Technical Details"
msgstr "Tehničke pojedinosti"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Technical Details">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid "Some assorted technical details:"
msgstr "Razne tehničke pojedinosti:"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Technical Details">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<code>rk.plot.history.summary(which,type)</code>: this helper function "
"provides some summaries about the screen device history. Here, <code>which</"
"code> is a \"device id\" (default is <i>NULL</i>: summaries about all "
"managed devices) and <code>type</code> is either <i>devices</i> (returns "
"device specific information) or <i>history</i> (returns information on all "
"the saved plots in the history)."
msgstr "<code>rk.plot.history.summary(which,type)</code>: ova pomoćna funkcija daje sažetak povijesti zaslonskog uređaja. Argument <code>which</code> jest „ID uređaja” (zadano je <i>NULL</i>, što daje sažetke za sve upravljane uređaje), a argument <code>type</code> može biti <i>devices</i> (vraća podatke o pojedinim uređajima) ili <i>history</i> (vraća podatke o svim spremljenim grafikonima u povijesti)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Technical Details">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Technically speaking, function calls that pass through either "
"<code>graphics::plot.new()</code> or <code>graphics::persp()</code> or "
"<code>lattice::print.trellis()</code> are captured."
msgstr "Tehnički gledano, bilježe se pozivi funkcija koji prolaze kroz <code>graphics::plot.new()</code>, <code>graphics::persp()</code> ili <code>lattice::print.trellis()</code>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Technical Details">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The base graphics plots are recorded and replayed using <code>recordPlot()</"
"code> and <code>replayPlot()</code>."
msgstr "Grafikoni iz osnovnog grafičkog sustava bilježe se i ponovno prikazuju pomoću funkcija <code>recordPlot()</code> i <code>replayPlot()</code>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <section title="Technical Details">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:39
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The lattice plots are added to the history using a custom <code>print."
"trellis()</code> function set by <code>lattice.options(\"print.function\")</"
"code>. So, you are warned against resetting or modifying this from a running "
"RKWard session. Similarly, you are very strongly advised against using the "
"<code>plot</code> method on a trellis object since it will not pass through "
"<code>print.trellis()</code> and hence not be stored in the history. This "
"may seem innocuous, but it will have irreparable consequences when trying to "
"use <code>trellis.last.object()</code>, thereafter. You have been warned!"
msgstr "Grafikoni latticea dodaju se u povijest pomoću prilagođene funkcije <code>print.trellis()</code>, postavljene funkcijom <code>lattice.options(\"print.function\")</code>. Stoga nemojte vraćati ni mijenjati tu postavku tijekom rada RKWarda. Također vam izričito savjetujemo da ne koristite metodu <code>plot</code> na objektu trellis jer ona neće pozvati <code>print.trellis()</code>, pa se grafikon neće spremiti u povijest. To se možda čini bezazlenim, ali može imati nepopravljive posljedice pri kasnijoj upotrebi funkcije <code>trellis.last.object()</code>. Upozoreni ste!"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <related>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:49
#, kde-format
msgid "<link href=\"rkward://rhelp/lattice.options\"/> (needs lattice)"
msgstr "<link href=\"rkward://rhelp/lattice.options\"/> (potreban je lattice)"

#. i18n: ectx: (Screen device history) <related>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_plot_history.rkh:49
#, kde-format
msgid "<link href=\"rkward://rhelp/trellis.last.object\"/> (needs lattice)"
msgstr "<link href=\"rkward://rhelp/trellis.last.object\"/> (potreban je lattice)"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard Shortcut keys"
msgstr "Tipkovni prečaci RKWarda"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can control RKWard in many situations without using a mouse device, "
"using only the keyboard. The easiest way to find out about shortcuts of "
"interest is to browse the menu. Shortcuts are listed next to their action in "
"the menu."
msgstr "RKWardom se u mnogim situacijama možete služiti bez miša, samo tipkovnicom. Najlakše ćete pronaći željene prečace pregledavanjem izbornika. Prečaci su u izborniku navedeni uz odgovarajuće radnje."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Another possibility is to use the heads-up display (HUD). The HUD menu is a "
"search field that allows fuzzy searching in the menus. The HUD was "
"introduced in current KDE applications and is therefore not yet available in "
"older RKWard versions. The HUD can be called up using Ctrl+Alt+i. This is "
"particularly useful if you are looking for a function, the shortcut of a "
"function or something in the menus, but do not want to go through each menu "
"individually to find it."
msgstr "Možete upotrijebiti i zaslonski izbornik za brzo pretraživanje (HUD). HUD je polje za pretraživanje koje omogućuje približno pretraživanje izbornika. Uveden je u novijim KDE aplikacijama pa još nije dostupan u starijim verzijama RKWarda. HUD možete otvoriti tipkama Ctrl+Alt+i. To je osobito korisno kada tražite neku funkciju, njezin tipkovni prečac ili stavku izbornika, a ne želite pojedinačno pregledavati svaki izbornik."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most shortcuts are configurable, using Settings->Configure Shortcuts. For "
"technical reasons, only the shortcuts of those components will be listed "
"that are active at that time. Hence, for example, if you want to edit the "
"shortcuts for the data editor, first open a data editor, then select "
"Settings->Configure Shortcuts. Most shortcuts for the script editor are "
"managed separately using Settings->Configure Editor->Shortcuts."
msgstr "Većinu prečaca možete prilagoditi putem Postavke->Postavljanje prečaca. Iz tehničkih se razloga prikazuju samo prečaci trenutačno aktivnih komponenti. Primjerice, ako želite urediti prečace uređivača podataka, najprije otvorite uređivač podataka, a zatim odaberite Postavke->Postavljanje prečaca. Većinom prečaca uređivača skripti upravlja se zasebno putem Postavke->Postavljanje uređivača->Prečaci."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"On most systems, you can also configure shortcuts by right-clicking on the "
"respective menu item."
msgstr "Na većini sustava prečace možete prilagoditi i desnim klikom na odgovarajuću stavku izbornika."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard Default Shortcut keys"
msgstr "Zadani tipkovni prečaci RKWarda"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="RKWard Default Shortcut keys">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid "To point out some of the less discoverable or more important shortcuts:"
msgstr "U nastavku su navedeni neki manje uočljivi ili važniji prečaci:"

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="RKWard Default Shortcut keys">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To cycle between document / tool windows inside RKWard, use Ctrl+Tab and Ctrl"
"+Shift+Tab"
msgstr "Za kružno prebacivanje između prozora dokumenata i alata u RKWardu upotrijebite Ctrl+Tab i Ctrl+Shift+Tab."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="RKWard Default Shortcut keys">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To run code from scripts / help pages / the console, select it, and use Ctrl"
"+Enter"
msgstr "Za pokretanje koda iz skripti, stranica pomoći ili konzole odaberite ga i pritisnite Ctrl+Enter."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="RKWard Default Shortcut keys">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"F2 to search the R help for the symbol under the cursor in scripts and the "
"console"
msgstr "Pritisnite F2 za pretraživanje pomoći za R prema simbolu ispod pokazivača u skriptama i konzoli."

#. i18n: ectx: (RKWard Shortcut keys) <section title="RKWard Default Shortcut keys">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_shortcuts.rkh:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Meta+n to bring up <link href=\"rkward://rkward_code_navigation\">Code "
"Navigation</link> mode in script windows"
msgstr "Pritisnite Meta+n za uključivanje načina rada <link href=\"rkward://rkward_code_navigation\">Navigacija kroz kod</link> u prozorima skripti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Split views"
msgstr "Podijeljeni prikazi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:10
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Split views can be used to partition the main window into several view areas."
msgstr "Podijeljenim prikazima glavni prozor možete razdijeliti na nekoliko područja prikaza."

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:10
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"They can be used to make better use of screen space, but also to view far-"
"apart portions of a single file, simultaneously."
msgstr "Tako možete bolje iskoristiti prostor na zaslonu, ali i istodobno prikazati dijelove iste datoteke koji su međusobno udaljeni."

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid "Splitting views"
msgstr "Podjela prikaza"

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <section title="Splitting views">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Splitting views is currently supported for the main window, only. Use Window-"
">Split Vertical or Window->Split Horizontal to split the current view area "
"vertically, or horizontally. For windows that support it (e.g. scripts, help "
"pages), the newly created view area will contain a copy of the current "
"window. When splitting other windows (such as onscreen graphics devices), "
"the new view area will be initialized to show this help page."
msgstr "Podjela prikaza trenutačno je podržana samo u glavnom prozoru. Odaberite Prozor->Podijeli okomito ili Prozor->Podijeli vodoravno da biste trenutačno područje prikaza podijelili okomito ili vodoravno. U prozorima koji to podržavaju (npr. skriptama i stranicama pomoći) novo će područje prikaza sadržavati kopiju trenutačnog prozora. Pri podjeli drugih prozora (primjerice grafičkih uređaja na zaslonu), u novom će se području prikaza otvoriti ova stranica pomoći."

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <section title="Splitting views">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To add further files to a view area, simply open them the normal way (from "
"\"File Browser\" window, the menu, or from the \"R Console\" window). Simply "
"make sure that the view area where you want them new window to open has "
"focus / is active."
msgstr "Da biste u područje prikaza dodali još datoteka, otvorite ih na uobičajen način (u prozoru „Preglednik datoteka”, putem izbornika ili u prozoru „Konzola R-a”). Samo provjerite je li aktivno područje prikaza u kojem želite otvoriti novi prozor."

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid "Closing split views"
msgstr "Zatvaranje podijeljenih prikaza"

#. i18n: ectx: (Split views) <section title="Closing split views">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_split_views.rkh:22
#, kde-format
msgid "To remove a view area, simply close all windows inside it."
msgstr "Da biste uklonili područje prikaza, zatvorite sve prozore u njemu."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <title>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:8
#, kde-format
msgid "Trouble Shooting / FAQ"
msgstr "Otklanjanje poteškoća / ČPP"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <summary>
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:9
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This page will try to cover some common issues you may encounter when using "
"RKWard. See also <link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/faq\">the online FAQ</"
"link>."
msgstr "Na ovoj su stranici opisani neki česti problemi na koje možete naići pri upotrebi RKWarda. Pogledajte i <link href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/faq\">mrežna često postavljana pitanja</link>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid "The \"Analysis\" menu is missing, or shows up as \"(no label)\""
msgstr "Nedostaje izbornik „Analiza” ili je prikazan kao „(bez oznake)”"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid "Missing menu items"
msgstr "Nedostaju stavke izbornika"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="The \"Analysis\" menu is missing, or shows up as \"(no label)\"">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:12
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This problem will often occur, when moving an RKWard installation to a "
"different path, esp. on Windows and Mac. You may have to visit Settings-"
">Configure RKWard->Plugins and re-add the relevant \".pluginmap\"-files. "
"Starting with version 0.6.3, RKWard should detect a changed installation "
"path, and adjust paths, automatically."
msgstr "Taj se problem često javlja pri premještanju instalacije RKWarda na drugu putanju, osobito u sustavima Windows i macOS. Možda ćete morati otvoriti Postavke->Postavljanje RKWarda->Dodaci i ponovno dodati odgovarajuće datoteke „.pluginmap”. Od verzije 0.6.3 RKWard bi trebao automatski prepoznati promijenjenu putanju instalacije i prilagoditi putanje."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid "The R backend crashed or failed to start"
msgstr "Pozadinski proces R-a srušio se ili se nije pokrenuo"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid "Crashed backend"
msgstr "Srušeni pozadinski proces"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="The R backend crashed or failed to start">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"At times the R backend will fail to start due to a configuration or "
"installation problem. Common causes are changed paths, or an update to R. "
"Usually, in these cases, the setup dialog is shown when starting RKWard, and "
"this allows to select a different installation of R. (Note: You will be "
"offered a selection of installations found a common paths, but you can also "
"specify a non-detected installation, manually.)"
msgstr "Pozadinski proces R-a ponekad se ne uspije pokrenuti zbog problema s konfiguracijom ili instalacijom. Česti su uzroci promijenjene putanje ili ažuriranje R-a. U takvim se slučajevima pri pokretanju RKWarda obično prikazuje dijaloški okvir za postavljanje, u kojem možete odabrati drugu instalaciju R-a. (Napomena: ponudit će vam se instalacije pronađene na uobičajenim putanjama, no možete i ručno navesti instalaciju koja nije automatski pronađena.)"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="The R backend crashed or failed to start">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In many cases, it will \"just work\" to select a version of R other than "
"what has been used at compile time. Should you run into trouble, it is "
"advised to use the same, or a similar version of R to what was available "
"during compilation, however."
msgstr "U mnogim će slučajevima odabir druge verzije R-a, različite od one upotrijebljene pri kompilaciji, jednostavno funkcionirati. Ako naiđete na probleme, ipak se preporučuje upotrijebiti istu ili sličnu verziju R-a kao onu dostupnu tijekom kompilacije."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="The R backend crashed or failed to start">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can manually change the R backend at any time, using Settings->Check "
"installation. Be sure to save your data, before changing the backend! You "
"can also use the command-line option --r-executable in order to start a "
"session using a specific installation of R."
msgstr "Pozadinski proces R-a možete u bilo kojem trenutku ručno promijeniti putem Postavke->Provjeri instalaciju. Prije promjene svakako spremite podatke! Sesiju s određenom instalacijom R-a možete pokrenuti i pomoću opcije naredbenog retka --r-executable."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:28
#, kde-format
msgid "Why shouldn't I use R bundled inside the RKWard AppImage"
msgstr "Zašto ne bih trebao upotrebljavati R priložen uz AppImage RKWarda?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:28
#, kde-format
msgid "AppImage"
msgstr "AppImage"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="Why shouldn't I use R bundled inside the RKWard AppImage">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:28
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The AppImage includes an installation of R for convenience, but this "
"installation is not, and cannot technically be made fully functional. "
"Importantly, you will not generally be able to install R packages (other "
"than ones implemented purely in R). Also, you may run into conflicts between "
"the R installation inside the AppImage, and R packages that are installed "
"system-wide. This may cause subtle and surprising bugs."
msgstr "AppImage radi praktičnosti sadrži instalaciju R-a, ali ona nije potpuno funkcionalna niti se to tehnički može postići. Važno je da u pravilu nećete moći instalirati pakete za R, osim onih napisanih isključivo u R-u. Mogući su i sukobi između instalacije R-a u AppImageu i paketa za R instaliranih na razini cijelog sustava, što može uzrokovati prikrivene i neočekivane pogreške."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes I enter a command short after the start of RKWard but it is not "
"processed. What's wrong?"
msgstr "Ponekad unesem naredbu ubrzo nakon pokretanja RKWarda, ali ona se ne izvrši. U čemu je problem?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Commands not processing"
msgstr "Naredbe se ne izvršavaju"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="Sometimes I enter a command short after the start of RKWard but it is not processed. What's wrong?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This happens because RKWard starts first and subsequent R is started in the "
"background. Depending on the speed of your machine it can take some time to "
"start R. In any case you can check the state of R within RKWard. Just look "
"at the little box on the right bottom corner of RKWard. If it is green you "
"can go ahead."
msgstr "To se događa zato što se najprije pokreće RKWard, a zatim se R pokreće u pozadini. Ovisno o brzini računala, pokretanje R-a može potrajati. Stanje R-a možete provjeriti u RKWardu: pogledajte mali okvir u donjem desnom kutu prozora. Ako je zelen, možete nastaviti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="Sometimes I enter a command short after the start of RKWard but it is not processed. What's wrong?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:33
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You can start submitting commands while the backend has not yet started, or "
"while another lengthy calculation is still taking place. In this case your "
"commands will be placed into a queue, first, and executed as soon as the "
"backend becomes available, again."
msgstr "Naredbe možete slati i dok se pozadinski proces još pokreće ili dok je u tijeku dulji izračun. U tom će se slučaju naredbe najprije staviti u red čekanja i izvršiti čim pozadinski proces ponovno bude dostupan."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard says it needs a package. Was the installation of RKWard not complete?"
msgstr "RKWard javlja da mu je potreban paket. Je li instalacija RKWarda bila nepotpuna?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid "Missing packages"
msgstr "Nedostaju paketi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard says it needs a package. Was the installation of RKWard not complete?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard has basically all the functionality, which comes with the standard "
"packages of R. But RKWard is at the same time rather extensible. Many "
"developers made use of this and thus some of the procedures in RKWard depend "
"on \"external\" packages (obtained from <link href=\"http://cran.r-project."
"org/\">The Comprehensive R Archive Network (CRAN)</link>) to perform a task."
msgstr "RKWard u osnovi obuhvaća sve funkcionalnosti koje pružaju standardni paketi R-a. Istodobno se može znatno proširivati. Mnogi su razvojni programeri to iskoristili pa neki postupci u RKWardu ovise o „vanjskim” paketima (dostupnima putem <link href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/\">sveobuhvatne mrežne arhive za R (CRAN)</link>)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard says it needs a package. Was the installation of RKWard not complete?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here is an example. All tests related to <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/moments"
"\">skewness</link> and <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/moments\">kurtosis</link> "
"(which you would certainly expect to be shipped as a base package of R) are "
"performed from an external package. If you read this the first time or "
"restarted RKWard after you installed it and try to follow the link you will "
"be out of luck. First you need to run a test from Analysis->Moment to "
"achieve this."
msgstr "Primjerice, svi testovi povezani s <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/moments\">asimetrijom</link> i <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/moments\">kurtozom</link> (za koje biste sigurno očekivali da su dio osnovnog paketa R-a) nalaze se u vanjskom paketu. Ako ovo čitate prvi put ili ste nakon instalacije ponovno pokrenuli RKWard, poveznica vam neće pomoći. Najprije morate pokrenuti test iz izbornika Analiza->Moment."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard says it needs a package. Was the installation of RKWard not complete?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Typically, you would call them from R via <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/update."
"packages\">update.packages</link> and <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/library"
"\">library</link> to achieve this. But RKWard simplifies this for you. "
"You'll be guided through the install procedure for the required package. "
"Please note you need root privileges in certain situations."
msgstr "U R-u biste ih obično pozvali pomoću funkcija <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/update.packages\">update.packages</link> i <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/library\">library</link>. RKWard vam to pojednostavnjuje i vodi vas kroz instalaciju potrebnog paketa. Imajte na umu da će vam u nekim slučajevima trebati administratorske ovlasti."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:45
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard claims to take care of seamless integration with an office-suite. Why "
"is there no native option to save it as an office file?"
msgstr "RKWard obećava besprijekornu integraciju s uredskim paketom. Zašto ne postoji ugrađena mogućnost spremanja u uredski format?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:45
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard integration with an office-suite"
msgstr "Integracija RKWarda s uredskim paketom"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard claims to take care of seamless integration with an office-suite. Why is there no native option to save it as an office file?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:45
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"We agree that RKWard is still very lacking when it comes to office "
"integration, and \"seamless\" integration is still far away. Refer to <link "
"href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/> for information on how to accomplish "
"the most important things right now. In the meantime, it is possible to "
"carry out analyses in RMarkdown documents. These can be saved as PDF, TeX "
"document or Office document, among others. Current RKWard versions support "
"this in principle in the export menu."
msgstr "Slažemo se da RKWardu još mnogo toga nedostaje u pogledu integracije s uredskim paketima te da je „besprijekorna” integracija još daleko. Upute za najvažnije postupke potražite na stranici <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/>. U međuvremenu analize možete provoditi u dokumentima R Markdown, koji se, među ostalim, mogu spremiti kao PDF, TeX ili uredski dokument. Novije verzije RKWarda načelno podržavaju tu mogućnost u izborniku za izvoz."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:48
#, kde-format
msgid "People tend to ask me what RKWard means. What should I answer?"
msgstr "Ljudi me često pitaju što znači RKWard. Što da im odgovorim?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:48
#, kde-format
msgid "What does \"RKWard\" mean?"
msgstr "Što znači „RKWard”?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="People tend to ask me what RKWard means. What should I answer?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:48
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Yes, it's a very odd name. ;) However, R comes obviously from the <link href="
"\"http://www.r-project.org/\">R-language</link>, which is the statistical "
"basis of RKWard. K is derived from <link href=\"http://kde.org/\">KDE</"
"link>, which delivered the basic GUI technologies for RKWard. And <link href="
"\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ward\">Ward</link>? That's another story."
msgstr "Da, ime je prilično neobično. ;) Slovo R očito dolazi od <link href=\"http://www.r-project.org/\">jezika R</link>, statističke osnove RKWarda. Slovo K potječe od <link href=\"http://kde.org/\">KDE-a</link>, koji je RKWardu pružio osnovne tehnologije grafičkog korisničkog sučelja. A <link href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ward\">Ward</link>? To je već druga priča."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard is running since ages. Has it hung up?"
msgstr "RKWard radi već dugo. Je li se zamrznuo?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid "RKWard seems to hang"
msgstr "Čini se da se RKWard zamrznuo"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard is running since ages. Has it hung up?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This depends. Some test and plots just need some time if you have huge "
"amounts of data or sophisticated calculations. Therefore patience is "
"sometimes needed. In any case you can check the state of R within RKWard. "
"Just look at the little box on the right bottom corner of RKWard. Red means "
"there is still something to calculate or plot. If it turns green, R is done "
"calculating."
msgstr "Ovisi o situaciji. Neki testovi i grafovi zahtijevaju više vremena kada imate mnogo podataka ili su izračuni složeni, pa je ponekad potrebno pričekati. Stanje R-a možete provjeriti u RKWardu: pogledajte mali okvir u donjem desnom kutu prozora. Crvena boja znači da je još u tijeku izračun ili izrada grafa. Kada okvir postane zelen, R je završio izračun."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard is running since ages. Has it hung up?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"But some statistical test are rather memory and stack hungry and can make "
"the entire system unresponsive, if there is a lot of swapping. This is not a "
"bug in RKWard or R, just the calculation taking your system to its limits. "
"An example of very memory hungry tests are the <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/"
"wilcox.test\">Wilcoxon Rank Sum and Signed Rank Tests</link>."
msgstr "Međutim, neki statistički testovi zahtijevaju mnogo memorije i prostora na stogu te mogu učiniti cijeli sustav neodzivnim ako se intenzivno koristi stranična memorija. To nije pogreška u RKWardu ni R-u, već znak da izračun opterećuje sustav do krajnjih granica. Primjer vrlo zahtjevnih testova su <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/wilcox.test\">Wilcoxonov test zbroja rangova i test predznaka rangova</link>."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="RKWard is running since ages. Has it hung up?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Therefore, it is important you know the test. Moreover, it's very important "
"to save the workspace and other sections you worked on before you do such "
"operations. There is currently no recovery functionality within RKWard in "
"case of a crash! You can find build-in tests from R to address this memory "
"issue (see: <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/mem.limits\"/>, and <link href="
"\"rkward://rhelp/memory.limit\"/>)."
msgstr "Zato je važno da poznajete test koji pokrećete. Prije takvih postupaka posebno je važno spremiti radni prostor i ostale datoteke na kojima ste radili. RKWard trenutačno nema mogućnost oporavka nakon rušenja! Za rješavanje problema s memorijom možete upotrijebiti ugrađene funkcije R-a (pogledajte <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/mem.limits\"/> i <link href=\"rkward://rhelp/memory.limit\"/>)."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:58
#, kde-format
msgid "I think I did something wrong? Where is 'Undo' and 'Redo'?"
msgstr "Mislim da sam nešto pogriješio. Gdje su naredbe „Poništi” i „Ponovi”?"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section shorttitle="...">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:58
#, kde-format
msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "Poništi / Ponovi"

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="I think I did something wrong? Where is 'Undo' and 'Redo'?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Right now RKWard doesn't have \"undo\" or \"redo\" functionality in all "
"places. For example there is such functionality for the script editor, but "
"there is no undo or redo for finished plots or tests. Therefore it's "
"important that you know what you do before you start. It's recommended to "
"use copies of original data and to give everything a meaningful name."
msgstr "RKWard trenutačno nema mogućnosti „poništi” i „ponovi” u svim dijelovima programa. Primjerice, te su mogućnosti dostupne u uređivaču skripti, ali ne i za dovršene grafove ili testove. Zato je važno znati što radite prije nego što počnete. Preporučuje se raditi s kopijama izvornih podataka i svemu dodijeliti smislen naziv."

#. i18n: ectx: (Trouble Shooting / FAQ) <section title="I think I did something wrong? Where is 'Undo' and 'Redo'?">
#: rkward/pages/rkward_trouble_shooting.rkh:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"However, RKWard tries to give you as much information as possible about "
"things you have done. For tests and plots that you run from the menu, the "
"<link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/> will contain a \"run again\" "
"link below the output. You can use this to re-do this action with identical "
"or slightly modified settings. Also, tests and plots try to show the most "
"relevant settings in combination with the creation date. Moreover you can "
"check and copy any code generated for your documentation purposes."
msgstr "RKWard vam ipak nastoji pružiti što više informacija o obavljenim radnjama. Za testove i grafove pokrenute iz izbornika stranica <link href=\"rkward://page/rkward_output\"/> ispod izlaza sadržavat će poveznicu „pokreni ponovno”. Njome možete ponoviti radnju s istim ili neznatno izmijenjenim postavkama. Uz datum izrade prikazuju se i najvažnije postavke testova i grafova. Osim toga, možete pregledati i kopirati generirani kod radi dokumentiranja svojeg rada."

